---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Submit an Idea | Citizen Stewardship"
  description="How to suggest civic reform proposals and improvements."
>
  <h1>Submit an Idea</h1>
  <p>This is a static site. There is no backend submission form.</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Submit through the public discussion board</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mailto:contact@citizenstewardship.org?subject=Citizen%20Stewardship%20proposal%20suggestion">Email contact@citizenstewardship.org</a>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Suggested submission format</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>What problem are you trying to solve?</li>
      <li>What reform are you proposing?</li>
      <li>Why is it necessary?</li>
      <li>What are the immediate benefits?</li>
      <li>What are the risks or downsides?</li>
      <li>What are the long-term benefits?</li>
      <li>Who would support it?</li>
      <li>Who might oppose it?</li>
      <li>What sources support your argument?</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
